              "quote": "Other abilities will create mirror chakrams that he gathers, and his basic attacks deal bonus physical damage based on how many mirror chakrams he holds.",
              "source_id": "wiki:crescendum"
            },
            {
              "quote": "Chakram duration is refreshed when Aphelios catches a new one or attacks a champion with Crescendum.",
              "source_id": "wiki:crescendum"
            }
          ],
          "id": "crescendum_mirrors",
          "summary": "Abilities generate mirror chakrams that strengthen Crescendum attacks; catching more or attacking champions with Crescendum refreshes their duration."
        }
